  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "孤岛式潜水集训  (Surprise Dawn Cameras and Diving Drills)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "crew": "场务",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At crack of dawn, Xingtian's camera crew walks straight into the replacement idol's hotel suite with phones confiscated under island-training rules—and marches him to the diving pool. Listen to the chaos first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "我们已经开始录了，你自然点就行啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "不是，我还没起床呢，你别录，别录！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谁让你们大早上来拍的？拍之前不通知一下吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "贾先生，个人通讯设备都已经上交给节目组了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "咱们这是孤岛式培训，给您说过多少次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "来来来，时间真不早了，贾先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天培训的项目就是潜水，这位是咱们的资深潜水教练。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "咱们今天上午要完成八十分钟的拍摄素材。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "多长时间？八十分钟？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "贾先生你别紧张，咱们先热身一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "不是，别碰我，我不下水！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "我们已经开始录了，你自然点就行啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are already rolling—just act natural.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "不是，我还没起床呢，你别录，别录！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on—I am not even out of bed yet! Stop filming, stop filming!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谁让你们大早上来拍的？拍之前不通知一下吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who told you to barge in filming at dawn without giving notice beforehand?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "贾先生，个人通讯设备都已经上交给节目组了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Jia, all personal phones have already been turned in to the production crew.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "咱们这是孤岛式培训，给您说过多少次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ours is isolated island-style training, just as we reminded you many times.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "来来来，时间真不早了，贾先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come along—it is getting late, Mr Jia.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天培训的项目就是潜水，这位是咱们的资深潜水教练。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today's training event is scuba diving, and here is our senior diving coach.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "咱们今天上午要完成八十分钟的拍摄素材。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This morning we need to complete eighty minutes of usable diving footage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "多长时间？八十分钟？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How long did you say? Eighty minutes?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "贾先生你别紧张，咱们先热身一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not be nervous, Mr Jia—let us warm up first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "不是，别碰我，我不下水！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait—hands off me, I am not getting near that water!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
